help:
Here is what I can do:
• "taken" or "+" marks the main medication for today, "taken levothyroxine" marks a supportive one, "skip" records a skipped dose;
• "status" shows today's doses;
• a diary entry in one line: "pressure 135/85, fatigue 2, weight 71, temp 37.1, wellbeing 4, sleep bad" (you can start with "yesterday");
• a lab PDF: I read it and save it to MedControl, you can send several files in a row. AI reads a report from an unknown lab, and you confirm the result.
